(5121377, 746180, 96751, '<td valign="top">Right idea, iffy set-up.  I don''t know enough about photographic terms to explain what I see, but the foreground position feels off-balance, and the background is too predominant.</td>', 'Right idea, iffy set-up.  I don''t know enough about photographic terms to explain what I see, but the foreground position feels off-balance, and the background is too predominant.', '2008-12-10 02:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
