(5121379, 744613, 96751, '<td valign="top">Different interpretation of "before and after".  Might get dinged for it.</td>', 'Different interpretation of "before and after".  Might get dinged for it.', '2008-12-10 02:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121380, 746197, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great abstract.</td>', 'Great abstract.', '2008-12-10 02:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121381, 745849, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I almost posted an OJ picture for this challenge too :-)</td>', 'Nice shot.  I almost posted an OJ picture for this challenge too :-)', '2008-12-10 02:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121383, 746099, 96751, '<td valign="top">I know that the finished product is in the middle for balance, but the logic center of my brain tells me the objects are out of order :-)</td>', 'I know that the finished product is in the middle for balance, but the logic center of my brain tells me the objects are out of order :-)', '2008-12-10 02:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121384, 746071, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I LOVE this shot.  Great concept.  Excellent execution.  And your dad''s a trooper.</td>', 'Excellent.  I LOVE this shot.  Great concept.  Excellent execution.  And your dad''s a trooper.', '2008-12-10 02:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121385, 745985, 100393, '<td valign="top">Why before and after?</td>', 'Why before and after?', '2008-12-10 02:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121386, 746071, 100393, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2008-12-10 02:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121388, 746013, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is just a magnificent picture. The reflection is incredible.  An onion never looked this beautiful.  Rather Jupiter-esque...  But the rings are not so much "after" as just a different presentation.  Maybe if they had been deep-fried?</td>', 'This is just a magnificent picture. The reflection is incredible.  An onion never looked this beautiful.  Rather Jupiter-esque...  But the rings are not so much "after" as just a different presentation.  Maybe if they had been deep-fried?', '2008-12-10 02:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121389, 746199, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very well executed.</td>', 'Very well executed.', '2008-12-10 02:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121390, 746063, 96751, '<td valign="top">I had to really look at this a while to figure out that the "wall" was a slice of bread with peanut butter on it.  I wish peanut butter had more of a presence in this shot.</td>', 'I had to really look at this a while to figure out that the "wall" was a slice of bread with peanut butter on it.  I wish peanut butter had more of a presence in this shot.', '2008-12-10 02:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121391, 745438, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''ve no idea how you did this.... real car?? Great photo.</td>', 'I''ve no idea how you did this.... real car?? Great photo.', '2008-12-10 02:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121394, 745373, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I feel that less distance between the grater and the grated carrots, and a little less grater, might have improved this shot.</td>', 'Nice!  I feel that less distance between the grater and the grated carrots, and a little less grater, might have improved this shot.', '2008-12-10 02:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121396, 744945, 96751, '<td valign="top">If the lighting on the soup would have been as stellar as the lighting on the tomatoes, I''d have given this a really high score.</td>', 'If the lighting on the soup would have been as stellar as the lighting on the tomatoes, I''d have given this a really high score.', '2008-12-10 02:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121398, 745128, 96751, '<td valign="top">The grapes are WAY too dark making them look more like olives.</td>', 'The grapes are WAY too dark making them look more like olives.', '2008-12-10 02:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121399, 745780, 96751, '<td valign="top">Isn''t wheat just beautiful?  I''d have loved a little more contrast.</td>', 'Isn''t wheat just beautiful?  I''d have loved a little more contrast.', '2008-12-10 02:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121400, 746028, 96751, '<td valign="top">The colors are really great in this, as is the texture of the tablecloth.  But there''s just way too much going on here.  A tighter crop, or shallower dof may have helped.</td>', 'The colors are really great in this, as is the texture of the tablecloth.  But there''s just way too much going on here.  A tighter crop, or shallower dof may have helped.', '2008-12-10 02:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121401, 746174, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the concept.  Life/death, yin/yang.  Nice work.  But the uneven edge of the cut-outs really detracts from the image.</td>', 'Love the concept.  Life/death, yin/yang.  Nice work.  But the uneven edge of the cut-outs really detracts from the image.', '2008-12-10 02:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121402, 745958, 100393, '<td valign="top">A nice idea but I think to pull this off the focus needs to be sharper than this.</td>', 'A nice idea but I think to pull this off the focus needs to be sharper than this.', '2008-12-10 02:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121403, 746106, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s just sad.  Nice idea.</td>', 'Oh, that''s just sad.  Nice idea.', '2008-12-10 02:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121404, 746177, 96751, '<td valign="top">You''ve got my heart :-)  But I think it''s over-sharpened, and oversaturated.</td>', 'You''ve got my heart :-)  But I think it''s over-sharpened, and oversaturated.', '2008-12-10 02:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121405, 746137, 100393, '<td valign="top">The idea is OK, but technically this is way off the mark - lighting, background, noise, exposure, focus, composition. Perhaps it was all deliberate but it doesn''t work for me.<br/> <br/>Sorry, but I thought I should justify the low mark I have given.</td>', 'The idea is OK, but technically this is way off the mark - lighting, background, noise, exposure, focus, composition. Perhaps it was all deliberate but it doesn''t work for me. Sorry, but I thought I should justify the low mark I have given.', '2008-12-10 02:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121406, 745897, 96751, '<td valign="top">In terms of color, this is the winner.  But the image is so busy, and the arrangement of the flowers too subtle.  In fact, I almost didn''t see the "not".</td>', 'In terms of color, this is the winner.  But the image is so busy, and the arrangement of the flowers too subtle.  In fact, I almost didn''t see the "not".', '2008-12-10 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121407, 746064, 100393, '<td valign="top">Finally, a Woody picture I do like.</td>', 'Finally, a Woody picture I do like.', '2008-12-10 02:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121409, 745824, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I really like the concept, but I''m struggling to love this and I don''t know why I don''t.  It all looks unfocused or too noisy or something.</td>', 'Interesting.  I really like the concept, but I''m struggling to love this and I don''t know why I don''t.  It all looks unfocused or too noisy or something.', '2008-12-10 02:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121410, 746192, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice dof.  I feel this might have been a stronger image from just a tad higher.  The point looks a bit weird.</td>', 'Nice dof.  I feel this might have been a stronger image from just a tad higher.  The point looks a bit weird.', '2008-12-10 02:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121411, 745374, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great concept shot.</td>', 'Great concept shot.', '2008-12-10 02:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121412, 745438, 96751, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot.  You''d better be telling us how you did this.</td>', 'GREAT shot.  You''d better be telling us how you did this.', '2008-12-10 02:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121413, 746103, 100393, '<td valign="top">Wow - under basic too. Single long exposure, physical masking, two glasses and a change of lighting?? That must have been hard to pull off.</td>', 'Wow - under basic too. Single long exposure, physical masking, two glasses and a change of lighting?? That must have been hard to pull off.', '2008-12-10 02:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121414, 744986, 100393, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but the border gets in the way.</td>', 'Nice picture but the border gets in the way.', '2008-12-10 02:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5121417, 746183, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, THAT''s a lot of work!  Really nice execution.  I''m undecided about the white decorative dots on the plate.</td>', 'Oh, THAT''s a lot of work!  Really nice execution.  I''m undecided about the white decorative dots on the plate.', '2008-12-10 02:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
