(5122411, 746104, 98171, '<td valign="top">Of course I said "Aww" when I saw this. My only complaint is that I wish the baby was interacting with her tummy more. I mean, I can tell that maybe he''s listening, but it kind of looks like he is not interested. I also wish the pregnant woman was holding the baby instead of someone else. Other than that, I think its a great photo.  Lighting is great, B&amp;W rocks. -8</td>', 'Of course I said "Aww" when I saw this. My only complaint is that I wish the baby was interacting with her tummy more. I mean, I can tell that maybe he''s listening, but it kind of looks like he is not interested. I also wish the pregnant woman was holding the baby instead of someone else. Other than that, I think its a great photo.  Lighting is great, B&W rocks. -8', '2008-12-10 11:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5122413, 746178, 98171, '<td valign="top">wow, very neat image.  The reflection really makes the picture, and the colors just pop of the page. Excellent job. -8</td>', 'wow, very neat image.  The reflection really makes the picture, and the colors just pop of the page. Excellent job. -8', '2008-12-10 11:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5122417, 745943, 75585, '<td valign="top">LOL - oh so so true.  I love the beers included and their quantity.  I hope people stop to read your title to tie it all together.  Fun!!</td>', 'LOL - oh so so true.  I love the beers included and their quantity.  I hope people stop to read your title to tie it all together.  Fun!!', '2008-12-10 11:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5122418, 745120, 98171, '<td valign="top">I actually said "WOW" when I saw this. The colors are just so vivid. The use of the orange background is great, and your oranges are really nice looking. I cant say that I love the idea, because it''s not the most creative, but overall, I think the quality of the photo more than makes up for it. -7</td>', 'I actually said "WOW" when I saw this. The colors are just so vivid. The use of the orange background is great, and your oranges are really nice looking. I cant say that I love the idea, because it''s not the most creative, but overall, I think the quality of the photo more than makes up for it. -7', '2008-12-10 11:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5122427, 745916, 98171, '<td valign="top">ooh, provocative.  I like your scene here, you really conveyed the idea well. If I''m interpreting this right, the girl''s clothes do not really match the idea behind the photo. Other than that, I think it''s a great image, I love the fact that the focus of the picture is way on the side and the back of the image. -8</td>', 'ooh, provocative.  I like your scene here, you really conveyed the idea well. If I''m interpreting this right, the girl''s clothes do not really match the idea behind the photo. Other than that, I think it''s a great image, I love the fact that the focus of the picture is way on the side and the back of the image. -8', '2008-12-10 11:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5122438, 746099, 98171, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I like this a lot. It''s subtle. You laid out the components of the image well, and the lighting really works with the wire. Good job =) - 7</td>', 'Hmm, I like this a lot. It''s subtle. You laid out the components of the image well, and the lighting really works with the wire. Good job =) - 7', '2008-12-10 11:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5122443, 745752, 98171, '<td valign="top">While this image is very visually interesting, I''m wondering where the "new pier" is? Is it that thing off in the distance? Anyway, great perspective and colors really make the photo. -6</td>', 'While this image is very visually interesting, I''m wondering where the "new pier" is? Is it that thing off in the distance? Anyway, great perspective and colors really make the photo. -6', '2008-12-10 11:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
