(5122457, 745447, 98171, '<td valign="top">wow, this is great. Very creative idea. I love how you even used maternity books for her to stand on.  I know it sucks that you have two whote spots near the bottom, but whatever. The picture is great. Perfect lighting, great setup, and very creative idea. <br/>8</td>', 'wow, this is great. Very creative idea. I love how you even used maternity books for her to stand on.  I know it sucks that you have two whote spots near the bottom, but whatever. The picture is great. Perfect lighting, great setup, and very creative idea. 8', '2008-12-10 11:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
