(5122471, 746000, 98171, '<td valign="top">love this picture! I;m a foodie, so I have a soft spot for food pics. Your lighting is excellent, and the setup is quite original. I like how you made sure there was crumbs, it really adds to the photo. You know you are going to have all the voters wanting a Reese''s now, right? =)<br/>I reserve 10''s for my personal favorites in a challenge..... -10</td>', 'love this picture! I;m a foodie, so I have a soft spot for food pics. Your lighting is excellent, and the setup is quite original. I like how you made sure there was crumbs, it really adds to the photo. You know you are going to have all the voters wanting a Reese''s now, right? =)I reserve 10''s for my personal favorites in a challenge..... -10', '2008-12-10 11:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
