(5123507, 746000, 94601, '<td valign="top">First of all- that looks delicious- R.PB cups are my fave!!!<br/> <br/>I really like this picture a lot- well lit, framed, and especially well set up... I like the crumbles on top of the cups.  I do wish the DOF was deeper.  I don''t mind the backs of the lower cups being out of focus, but I think I would prefer the back of the top cup to be in focus... personal opinion. Overall great shot!</td>', 'First of all- that looks delicious- R.PB cups are my fave!!! I really like this picture a lot- well lit, framed, and especially well set up... I like the crumbles on top of the cups.  I do wish the DOF was deeper.  I don''t mind the backs of the lower cups being out of focus, but I think I would prefer the back of the top cup to be in focus... personal opinion. Overall great shot!', '2008-12-10 18:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123509, 746180, 94601, '<td valign="top">Great set up and great blurred background.  I like it a lot.  The weird crack in the sharpened pencil is a bit distracting, as is the bottom of the cone? of the sharpened pencil (where the the green bumps up, right by the crack).  I don''t know if you left that in on purpose, but I may have rotated the pencil to get that out of the shot.  Photo technique wise, great!!!!</td>', 'Great set up and great blurred background.  I like it a lot.  The weird crack in the sharpened pencil is a bit distracting, as is the bottom of the cone? of the sharpened pencil (where the the green bumps up, right by the crack).  I don''t know if you left that in on purpose, but I may have rotated the pencil to get that out of the shot.  Photo technique wise, great!!!!', '2008-12-10 18:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123516, 746166, 94601, '<td valign="top">Very creative!.  I think you could have gone with an even tighter crop- the empty space of the forehead is not really needed and doesn''t add anything to the shot.  A tighter crop might help bring the eyes out more.  I also think the left eye came out quite clean, but the focus on the right eye looks softer (even on the reflection).  I''d love for this to be almost completely symmetrical/identical on both sides except for the makeup- that would make the difference stand out more.</td>', 'Very creative!.  I think you could have gone with an even tighter crop- the empty space of the forehead is not really needed and doesn''t add anything to the shot.  A tighter crop might help bring the eyes out more.  I also think the left eye came out quite clean, but the focus on the right eye looks softer (even on the reflection).  I''d love for this to be almost completely symmetrical/identical on both sides except for the makeup- that would make the difference stand out more.', '2008-12-10 18:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123521, 745128, 94601, '<td valign="top">Grapes to wine =o) Nice<br/> <br/>I think the shadows are too strong in the grapes- especially next to the bottle.  Other than that, nice set up, clean looking shot... Just not overly creative, but a nice simple shot.</td>', 'Grapes to wine =o) Nice I think the shadows are too strong in the grapes- especially next to the bottle.  Other than that, nice set up, clean looking shot... Just not overly creative, but a nice simple shot.', '2008-12-10 18:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123524, 746183, 31535, '<td valign="top">At first I was like "where is the before and after?" I think I''m going blind.<br/>Maybe a solid colour plate would be better. Those little white dots look out of place.</td>', 'At first I was like "where is the before and after?" I think I''m going blind.Maybe a solid colour plate would be better. Those little white dots look out of place.', '2008-12-10 18:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123527, 745751, 31535, '<td valign="top">Is this supposed to be orange juice. Why is it in a bowl?</td>', 'Is this supposed to be orange juice. Why is it in a bowl?', '2008-12-10 18:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123528, 745984, 94601, '<td valign="top">haha- funny title.<br/> <br/>I think this shot shows the before and the title explains the after, but would have liked to see both in the actually photo.  Photo itself has nice greens, and way to get all the cows looking at you.  Their faces are a bit dark (because the light is coming from behind).  Not bad. =o)</td>', 'haha- funny title. I think this shot shows the before and the title explains the after, but would have liked to see both in the actually photo.  Photo itself has nice greens, and way to get all the cows looking at you.  Their faces are a bit dark (because the light is coming from behind).  Not bad. =o)', '2008-12-10 18:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123531, 745931, 31535, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I don''t see a before and after though.</td>', 'Nice shot. I don''t see a before and after though.', '2008-12-10 19:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123533, 746159, 31535, '<td valign="top">I hope your not going to serve that to your guests.</td>', 'I hope your not going to serve that to your guests.', '2008-12-10 19:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123537, 745985, 94601, '<td valign="top">not 100% sure how this is "before and after"- the horizon is quite slanted too.  Sorry to say that I don''t really understand this photo.<br/> <br/>You did however catch a nice blue in the sky with some cloud contrast... if you straighten it up and crop out the bottom... say... half of the photo, you could end up with a decent cityscape.</td>', 'not 100% sure how this is "before and after"- the horizon is quite slanted too.  Sorry to say that I don''t really understand this photo. You did however catch a nice blue in the sky with some cloud contrast... if you straighten it up and crop out the bottom... say... half of the photo, you could end up with a decent cityscape.', '2008-12-10 19:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123538, 746118, 31535, '<td valign="top">That is one wrinkly cucumber. Did you stick it in a food dehydrator? Could use a little sharpening.</td>', 'That is one wrinkly cucumber. Did you stick it in a food dehydrator? Could use a little sharpening.', '2008-12-10 19:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123541, 746199, 94601, '<td valign="top">Great minds think alike.  I almost did the same thing.  Glad I didn''t!  This is well executed... I love the lighting, it''s full, but still leaves shadow for the dramatic feel.  My favorite is the way the texture comes through on the egg shells.  Well Done.</td>', 'Great minds think alike.  I almost did the same thing.  Glad I didn''t!  This is well executed... I love the lighting, it''s full, but still leaves shadow for the dramatic feel.  My favorite is the way the texture comes through on the egg shells.  Well Done.', '2008-12-10 19:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123547, 745757, 94601, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Great detail on the brown leaf.  I think just getting a little more in focus on the green leaf could go a long way, but that''s a personal opinion I guess.  Nice idea and nice shot.</td>', 'Nice.  Great detail on the brown leaf.  I think just getting a little more in focus on the green leaf could go a long way, but that''s a personal opinion I guess.  Nice idea and nice shot.', '2008-12-10 19:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123548, 744839, 31535, '<td valign="top">The grinds look funny in the top left corner. Dof needs to be expanded to bring more of the grinds into focus i think.</td>', 'The grinds look funny in the top left corner. Dof needs to be expanded to bring more of the grinds into focus i think.', '2008-12-10 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123551, 746010, 31535, '<td valign="top">Good setup, but why the bush in the background. Could you have not shot at a higher angle to avoid that?</td>', 'Good setup, but why the bush in the background. Could you have not shot at a higher angle to avoid that?', '2008-12-10 19:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123552, 745818, 94601, '<td valign="top">Why are pretzels so tasty and why do they crumble so much?<br/> <br/>Simple shot, but very well done.  Don''t have much to say, and I guess this is just nitpicky, but it feels just a tad off balance to me since it''s essentially a "3 pretzel shot" - My eyes want to see the center pretzel in the center of the shot- so it feels a bit unbalanced to me... but once again, that''s just nitpicky.  Very nice.</td>', 'Why are pretzels so tasty and why do they crumble so much? Simple shot, but very well done.  Don''t have much to say, and I guess this is just nitpicky, but it feels just a tad off balance to me since it''s essentially a "3 pretzel shot" - My eyes want to see the center pretzel in the center of the shot- so it feels a bit unbalanced to me... but once again, that''s just nitpicky.  Very nice.', '2008-12-10 19:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123553, 745983, 94601, '<td valign="top">Yum!  Great shot of the poms.  I think because the pom is so dark, a lighter background could have helped the color pop more, but other than that, well executed and set up shot.</td>', 'Yum!  Great shot of the poms.  I think because the pom is so dark, a lighter background could have helped the color pop more, but other than that, well executed and set up shot.', '2008-12-10 19:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123556, 745918, 94601, '<td valign="top">I LOVE IT!  Wow, what perfect timing. I''m wondering how many tries it took to get this? Right after the balloon broke, but before the water could accelerate out of shape.  Creativity, execution, even the simple orange frame. 10 from me. Well done!</td>', 'I LOVE IT!  Wow, what perfect timing. I''m wondering how many tries it took to get this? Right after the balloon broke, but before the water could accelerate out of shape.  Creativity, execution, even the simple orange frame. 10 from me. Well done!', '2008-12-10 19:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123557, 746000, 31535, '<td valign="top">I love peanut butter and i love chocolate, but i hate them together.<br/>I like the bottom piece and the one with the single bite. I think if you stayed with those it would be more impactful. The top two tiers look messy.</td>', 'I love peanut butter and i love chocolate, but i hate them together.I like the bottom piece and the one with the single bite. I think if you stayed with those it would be more impactful. The top two tiers look messy.', '2008-12-10 19:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123562, 746220, 31535, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and i like the tight crop. Your colour temp seems a bit warm as there is a yellow cast throughout.</td>', 'Nice composition and i like the tight crop. Your colour temp seems a bit warm as there is a yellow cast throughout.', '2008-12-10 19:13:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5123567, 746063, 31535, '<td valign="top">I think the main focus should be on the peanuts. There are too many in the front that are out of focus. I think if you left them out it wouldn''t look so busy.</td>', 'I think the main focus should be on the peanuts. There are too many in the front that are out of focus. I think if you left them out it wouldn''t look so busy.', '2008-12-10 19:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123570, 745329, 31535, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing before and after.</td>', 'I''m not seeing before and after.', '2008-12-10 19:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123572, 745757, 31535, '<td valign="top">Great macro. I love the muted colours. They blend so well together.</td>', 'Great macro. I love the muted colours. They blend so well together.', '2008-12-10 19:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123578, 745376, 31535, '<td valign="top">Crop is a bit tight. Why cut off part of the soles?</td>', 'Crop is a bit tight. Why cut off part of the soles?', '2008-12-10 19:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123582, 746103, 31535, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know how you did this with basic editing.</td>', 'I''d like to know how you did this with basic editing.', '2008-12-10 19:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123587, 746192, 31535, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF.</td>', 'Great use of DOF.', '2008-12-10 19:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123590, 746151, 31535, '<td valign="top">That is some collection. I love coke in a bottle especcially when it''s ice cold.</td>', 'That is some collection. I love coke in a bottle especcially when it''s ice cold.', '2008-12-10 19:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123592, 745942, 31535, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of pinicchio.</td>', 'Reminds me of pinicchio.', '2008-12-10 19:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123593, 746100, 31535, '<td valign="top">Great concept. The shadows look a bit noisy.</td>', 'Great concept. The shadows look a bit noisy.', '2008-12-10 19:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123598, 746031, 31535, '<td valign="top">Nice shot although the bottle looks "cut off." I think its the same effect when you crop a person at the knees or other joint. It looks incomplete.</td>', 'Nice shot although the bottle looks "cut off." I think its the same effect when you crop a person at the knees or other joint. It looks incomplete.', '2008-12-10 19:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123599, 745733, 31535, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting to accentuate the picture on the wall.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting to accentuate the picture on the wall.', '2008-12-10 19:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123602, 745556, 31535, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the centered composition. Maybe if you went with a square crop if might look better.</td>', 'I''m not fond of the centered composition. Maybe if you went with a square crop if might look better.', '2008-12-10 19:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123607, 744982, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and I love the DOF.</td>', 'Great lighting and I love the DOF.', '2008-12-10 19:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123609, 744613, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and color. I love the water drops. I wish the DOF was a little larger, still a great shot.</td>', 'Great lighting and color. I love the water drops. I wish the DOF was a little larger, still a great shot.', '2008-12-10 19:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123613, 746180, 31535, '<td valign="top">There is another entry similar to this. I think I like the burst of colour in this one better. Nicely done.</td>', 'There is another entry similar to this. I think I like the burst of colour in this one better. Nicely done.', '2008-12-10 19:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123615, 746094, 54478, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I wish the background was lit a little more uniform. I know getting the mushroom look is difficult, so great shot!</td>', 'Cool shot. I wish the background was lit a little more uniform. I know getting the mushroom look is difficult, so great shot!', '2008-12-10 19:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123620, 746167, 54478, '<td valign="top">I am having a hard time seeing if this one meets the challenge. Good photo. It feels a little dark. The lighting seems a little harsh around her jaw. Great model, but her lips don''t look uniform, or was that the subtle change?</td>', 'I am having a hard time seeing if this one meets the challenge. Good photo. It feels a little dark. The lighting seems a little harsh around her jaw. Great model, but her lips don''t look uniform, or was that the subtle change?', '2008-12-10 19:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123628, 745949, 31535, '<td valign="top">A little too contrasty for my taste.</td>', 'A little too contrasty for my taste.', '2008-12-10 19:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123629, 744839, 54478, '<td valign="top">I like the deep redish/brown coloration of the coffee grounds. I can see a bit of texture from your back ground on the lower right portion of the photo. Defiantly meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like the deep redish/brown coloration of the coffee grounds. I can see a bit of texture from your back ground on the lower right portion of the photo. Defiantly meets the challenge.', '2008-12-10 19:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123633, 745447, 31535, '<td valign="top">Hey we''ve got those books at home.<br/> <br/>Very cute little girl. I bet she''s happy to become a big sister.</td>', 'Hey we''ve got those books at home. Very cute little girl. I bet she''s happy to become a big sister.', '2008-12-10 19:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123639, 745983, 31535, '<td valign="top">I think a white background would make those seeds pop out more. As is, a boost of exposure might halp also.</td>', 'I think a white background would make those seeds pop out more. As is, a boost of exposure might halp also.', '2008-12-10 19:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123640, 746035, 31535, '<td valign="top">That''s hilarious. I can see some old american on a cruise ship somewhere wearing a shirt that looks just like that.</td>', 'That''s hilarious. I can see some old american on a cruise ship somewhere wearing a shirt that looks just like that.', '2008-12-10 19:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123642, 746035, 54478, '<td valign="top">Cute idea</td>', 'Cute idea', '2008-12-10 19:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123647, 745612, 54478, '<td valign="top">The image doesn''t feel very sharp. Getting in a little closer to the flower so it fills the frame I think would help the subject stand out. The bee adds to the photo.</td>', 'The image doesn''t feel very sharp. Getting in a little closer to the flower so it fills the frame I think would help the subject stand out. The bee adds to the photo.', '2008-12-10 19:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123654, 745751, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great idea and subject. Good lighting. I wish the bowl was position a little more to the left, leaving some more black in the frame.</td>', 'Great idea and subject. Good lighting. I wish the bowl was position a little more to the left, leaving some more black in the frame.', '2008-12-10 19:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123656, 745685, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great subjects. The lighting feels a little harsh. The white spot on the bottom left is also a little distracting. Beautiful flower.</td>', 'Great subjects. The lighting feels a little harsh. The white spot on the bottom left is also a little distracting. Beautiful flower.', '2008-12-10 19:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123657, 746220, 54478, '<td valign="top">Flip the pan 180 degrees and it would look like a face. Hehe... Good idea.</td>', 'Flip the pan 180 degrees and it would look like a face. Hehe... Good idea.', '2008-12-10 19:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123658, 746101, 54478, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Lighting is well done. I can see where the table and the backdrop begins on the left side of the vase, but not on the other side. I love the transition from freshly picked flowers to the slowly dying ones.</td>', 'Great idea. Lighting is well done. I can see where the table and the backdrop begins on the left side of the vase, but not on the other side. I love the transition from freshly picked flowers to the slowly dying ones.', '2008-12-10 19:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123663, 746092, 54478, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the circles kind of make it kernel look like those thought bubbles you would see in cartoon and comics. Almost as if the kernel was thinking about being popcorn. Lighting is good and I like how I can see some of the detail on the piece of pop corn.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the circles kind of make it kernel look like those thought bubbles you would see in cartoon and comics. Almost as if the kernel was thinking about being popcorn. Lighting is good and I like how I can see some of the detail on the piece of pop corn.', '2008-12-10 19:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123666, 746159, 54478, '<td valign="top">To me the photo doesn''t show before and after, even with the title. Ok lighting, but overall the photo looks like a snapshot.</td>', 'To me the photo doesn''t show before and after, even with the title. Ok lighting, but overall the photo looks like a snapshot.', '2008-12-10 19:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123718, 744593, 20324, '<td valign="top">Very interesting architectural combination, perfect subject for the challenge!</td>', 'Very interesting architectural combination, perfect subject for the challenge!', '2008-12-10 20:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123895, 746167, 37845, '<td valign="top">I was only able to see the differences in makeup after having read the title. The black and white conversion took away from the colour, and also from conveying the before and after.</td>', 'I was only able to see the differences in makeup after having read the title. The black and white conversion took away from the colour, and also from conveying the before and after.', '2008-12-10 21:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
