(5123979, 746159, 47597, '<td valign="top">I can see the "after" but not the "before". Perhaps you could have tried to arrange the bowl more artfully or taken the shot from an interesting angle.</td>', 'I can see the "after" but not the "before". Perhaps you could have tried to arrange the bowl more artfully or taken the shot from an interesting angle.', '2008-12-10 22:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5123982, 746137, 47597, '<td valign="top">Good concept! I don''t like the green backdrop - perhaps a more neutral colour would have been better (white, black, cream?). Also, I think I can see creases in the fabric which you could have tried to iron out before shooting.</td>', 'Good concept! I don''t like the green backdrop - perhaps a more neutral colour would have been better (white, black, cream?). Also, I think I can see creases in the fabric which you could have tried to iron out before shooting.', '2008-12-10 22:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
