(5124152, 745976, 31535, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a nice moment between mother and daughter. I like the B&amp;W conversion. The one thing that stick out clearly is the fact it''s crooked. I think if you straighten it, you may cut off a foot though.</td>', 'You''ve captured a nice moment between mother and daughter. I like the B&W conversion. The one thing that stick out clearly is the fact it''s crooked. I think if you straighten it, you may cut off a foot though.', '2008-12-11 01:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5124159, 746174, 31535, '<td valign="top">Really nice concept with good colours and contrast. Too bad the sunflower on the top didn''t look nicer. Also, the cutout of the ying yang doesn''t look too smooth. 7</td>', 'Really nice concept with good colours and contrast. Too bad the sunflower on the top didn''t look nicer. Also, the cutout of the ying yang doesn''t look too smooth. 7', '2008-12-11 01:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
