(5124167, 745988, 31535, '<td valign="top">Turtle. No egg. No turtle. Yeah turtle. Final answer.<br/> <br/>I like your subject. This turtle doesn''t have the colours that the recent frogs shots have, but you''ve complimented it with a neutral grey surface. This brings out the egg shell nicely. 7<br/> <br/>Ok, I''ve thought about it. Egg</td>', 'Turtle. No egg. No turtle. Yeah turtle. Final answer. I like your subject. This turtle doesn''t have the colours that the recent frogs shots have, but you''ve complimented it with a neutral grey surface. This brings out the egg shell nicely. 7 Ok, I''ve thought about it. Egg', '2008-12-11 01:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5124170, 745179, 31535, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections of the surface. It adds some life to this shot. The roll of film gets a little lost in the black background though.</td>', 'I like the reflections of the surface. It adds some life to this shot. The roll of film gets a little lost in the black background though.', '2008-12-11 01:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5124172, 746099, 31535, '<td valign="top">That looks like it took alot of work. Nicely done. I think it could have done without the plyers though.</td>', 'That looks like it took alot of work. Nicely done. I think it could have done without the plyers though.', '2008-12-11 01:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5124188, 745871, 31535, '<td valign="top">Without your title, this DNMC. I''ll give you leeway though because the titles are part of these challenges. Your lighting is nice and there is no discernable glare. The cans are well setup with all the logo clearly visible.</td>', 'Without your title, this DNMC. I''ll give you leeway though because the titles are part of these challenges. Your lighting is nice and there is no discernable glare. The cans are well setup with all the logo clearly visible.', '2008-12-11 02:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
