(5124224, 745374, 31535, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is good, although it would be nice for the highlight to be behind your subject. Right now, I look at your subject, but my eyes are drawn away to the bright spot on the top right.</td>', 'Your lighting is good, although it would be nice for the highlight to be behind your subject. Right now, I look at your subject, but my eyes are drawn away to the bright spot on the top right.', '2008-12-11 02:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
