(5125797, 746166, 67237, '<td valign="top">imho this would look much better at -1/3 f stop maybe -2/3..it looks over exposed as it is...good idea though</td>', 'imho this would look much better at -1/3 f stop maybe -2/3..it looks over exposed as it is...good idea though', '2008-12-11 19:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125823, 746206, 88580, '<td valign="top">I don''t imagine too many people would agree, but I really like the how the grittyness of the noise works against the soft, smooth tones of this shot (especially the background).  I think it only has a weak connection to the challenge theme, however.</td>', 'I don''t imagine too many people would agree, but I really like the how the grittyness of the noise works against the soft, smooth tones of this shot (especially the background).  I think it only has a weak connection to the challenge theme, however.', '2008-12-11 20:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125836, 745984, 88580, '<td valign="top">My first impression was, "Gah!  That''s way over saturated in the greens."  It kinda grows on me.  The grass has an eerie glow.  The orange fringing around the cows'' ears is a nice contrast to the green.  The blueish sheen on their backs is reminiscent of a comic book rendering of black hair (e.g. Superman).  I think you needed a burger in the shot to meet the challenge.</td>', 'My first impression was, "Gah!  That''s way over saturated in the greens."  It kinda grows on me.  The grass has an eerie glow.  The orange fringing around the cows'' ears is a nice contrast to the green.  The blueish sheen on their backs is reminiscent of a comic book rendering of black hair (e.g. Superman).  I think you needed a burger in the shot to meet the challenge.', '2008-12-11 20:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125841, 746063, 88580, '<td valign="top">This would have benefited from a larger DOF.</td>', 'This would have benefited from a larger DOF.', '2008-12-11 20:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125842, 745438, 88580, '<td valign="top">That''s a very bold, in-your-face before and after shot.</td>', 'That''s a very bold, in-your-face before and after shot.', '2008-12-11 20:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125848, 745916, 88580, '<td valign="top">I love all the <i>crap</i> in this shot.  Lots of nice textures to look at.</td>', 'I love all the crap in this shot.  Lots of nice textures to look at.', '2008-12-11 20:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125855, 746136, 88580, '<td valign="top">Nice literal interpretation, and the handwriting fits well. The shadow on the front of the paper is distracting.  If this were lit from an extremely low angle--so that it brought out the paper''s texture--I think it would have been better.</td>', 'Nice literal interpretation, and the handwriting fits well. The shadow on the front of the paper is distracting.  If this were lit from an extremely low angle--so that it brought out the paper''s texture--I think it would have been better.', '2008-12-11 20:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125857, 745835, 88580, '<td valign="top">That''s a strangely odd composition.</td>', 'That''s a strangely odd composition.', '2008-12-11 20:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125861, 745410, 88580, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the coffee &amp; beans shots.</td>', 'My favorite of the coffee & beans shots.', '2008-12-11 20:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125870, 746101, 88580, '<td valign="top">The transition from fresh to wilted is almost too subtle, but it reads like a book on the life and death of a rose.  I wonder if it would have been better to light it from the left so that the "dead" side would have been in shadows?</td>', 'The transition from fresh to wilted is almost too subtle, but it reads like a book on the life and death of a rose.  I wonder if it would have been better to light it from the left so that the "dead" side would have been in shadows?', '2008-12-11 20:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125899, 746013, 88580, '<td valign="top">The setup really makes this shot.</td>', 'The setup really makes this shot.', '2008-12-11 21:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5125908, 746092, 88580, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and title.</td>', 'Clever idea and title.', '2008-12-11 21:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
