(5126298, 745752, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really like how the front pier draws you into the image. The water is nice - silky - a sightly long exposure I would guess. Perhaps a little longer would have been nice as that would have brought more light past the shutter and given more detail to the old pier. While the darker image gives the sense of twilight, I just feel the need for more light. I do like the blue tones a lot.</td>', 'I really like how the front pier draws you into the image. The water is nice - silky - a sightly long exposure I would guess. Perhaps a little longer would have been nice as that would have brought more light past the shutter and given more detail to the old pier. While the darker image gives the sense of twilight, I just feel the need for more light. I do like the blue tones a lot.', '2008-12-12 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126301, 746110, 37252, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of nice textures here. Your choice of bowl is perfect as the color and texture of it fits in well here. The focus seems a little soft, but not bad.</td>', 'There are a lot of nice textures here. Your choice of bowl is perfect as the color and texture of it fits in well here. The focus seems a little soft, but not bad.', '2008-12-12 02:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
