(5126313, 746209, 37252, '<td valign="top">The idea is interesting. I am not a big fan of using statues and paintings to produce an image, but that is just my personal preference.</td>', 'The idea is interesting. I am not a big fan of using statues and paintings to produce an image, but that is just my personal preference.', '2008-12-12 02:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126315, 745943, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really like how you chose to do your background...it really sets this shot up nice. My eye is first drawn to the multiple bottles against the textured background, and then to the single bottle with the plain no thrills background. I feel you really did well in letting your image tell the story.</td>', 'I really like how you chose to do your background...it really sets this shot up nice. My eye is first drawn to the multiple bottles against the textured background, and then to the single bottle with the plain no thrills background. I feel you really did well in letting your image tell the story.', '2008-12-12 02:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126317, 745565, 37252, '<td valign="top">Good colors, lighting, and focus. I am not so sure I like the crop this tight as Santa''s full reflection would have been nice.</td>', 'Good colors, lighting, and focus. I am not so sure I like the crop this tight as Santa''s full reflection would have been nice.', '2008-12-12 02:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
