(5126575, 745410, 58457, '<td valign="top">A strong entry.  I could see this with a thick black frame hanging in a independent coffee shop.<br/> <br/><i>Edit:  Back to bump you up... my favorite in the challenge.</i></td>', 'A strong entry.  I could see this with a thick black frame hanging in a independent coffee shop. Edit:  Back to bump you up... my favorite in the challenge.', '2008-12-12 09:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126590, 745918, 91282, '<td valign="top">While I think this shot is neat (and probably took a lot of skill and shots to capture at just the right moment), it seems a little flat to me somehow. Maybe its the lighting?</td>', 'While I think this shot is neat (and probably took a lot of skill and shots to capture at just the right moment), it seems a little flat to me somehow. Maybe its the lighting?', '2008-12-12 09:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126603, 746218, 91282, '<td valign="top">I like the original take this has, but I almost feel like there''s too much in this picture; It detracts away from the B&amp;A subject (eggs). I would''ve liked this better if it were cropped/zoomed in closer to the eggs. I like the hatchet though; Its unexpected. You must have some kind of contempt for eggs. :)</td>', 'I like the original take this has, but I almost feel like there''s too much in this picture; It detracts away from the B&A subject (eggs). I would''ve liked this better if it were cropped/zoomed in closer to the eggs. I like the hatchet though; Its unexpected. You must have some kind of contempt for eggs. :)', '2008-12-12 09:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126609, 745036, 91282, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful photo. However, it doesn''t say "Before and After" to me. Unless you think about it as she has been here before we came and will remain here after? No, it doesn''t quite work for me.. Sorry. I would''ve rated this higher if it were a different challenge topic.</td>', 'This is a very beautiful photo. However, it doesn''t say "Before and After" to me. Unless you think about it as she has been here before we came and will remain here after? No, it doesn''t quite work for me.. Sorry. I would''ve rated this higher if it were a different challenge topic.', '2008-12-12 09:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126622, 746178, 91282, '<td valign="top">An original approach, but it doesn''t really do it for me.. Some areas are OOF and the reflection actually feels a little distracting. I do like the brightness of the colors though. It looks a little like the clay on the right is a giant, colorful clam that made all these colorful pearls around it. :)</td>', 'An original approach, but it doesn''t really do it for me.. Some areas are OOF and the reflection actually feels a little distracting. I do like the brightness of the colors though. It looks a little like the clay on the right is a giant, colorful clam that made all these colorful pearls around it. :)', '2008-12-12 09:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126634, 745988, 91282, '<td valign="top">That may be one of the cutest turtle pics I''ve ever seen. :) The detail and lighting on him is excellent. Part of me almost thinks he looks too good to be a real turtle. lol I would''ve liked to have seen the rest of the egg in the shot, though, and the lighting on the egg shells is off to me. The right side is very bright and the left side is kind of an off/splotchy color. It looks like pieces from two different eggs.</td>', 'That may be one of the cutest turtle pics I''ve ever seen. :) The detail and lighting on him is excellent. Part of me almost thinks he looks too good to be a real turtle. lol I would''ve liked to have seen the rest of the egg in the shot, though, and the lighting on the egg shells is off to me. The right side is very bright and the left side is kind of an off/splotchy color. It looks like pieces from two different eggs.', '2008-12-12 09:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126638, 745447, 91282, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Too bad its a little OOF. I would''ve like to have seen this cropped a little closer to the subjects. and without the bandaid on the finger.</td>', 'Cute idea. Too bad its a little OOF. I would''ve like to have seen this cropped a little closer to the subjects. and without the bandaid on the finger.', '2008-12-12 09:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126642, 746157, 91282, '<td valign="top">Lighting is great, subjects are crisp, definitely meets challenge. Great shot. :)</td>', 'Lighting is great, subjects are crisp, definitely meets challenge. Great shot. :)', '2008-12-12 09:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126648, 745556, 91282, '<td valign="top">Wow, that squirrel went to town on that thing! I like the subjects and the idea. However, the lighting could be a little better; The front of the pine cone could use some more. And probably should''ve cloned out the little dusties at the bottom, too.</td>', 'Wow, that squirrel went to town on that thing! I like the subjects and the idea. However, the lighting could be a little better; The front of the pine cone could use some more. And probably should''ve cloned out the little dusties at the bottom, too.', '2008-12-12 09:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126654, 745235, 91282, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of the buck. Would''ve like the yearling to have been a little crisper. Probably wouldn''t have cropped it so close to the yearling either. Still, that is a really beautiful picture of the buck. You should be proud of it.</td>', 'Beautiful picture of the buck. Would''ve like the yearling to have been a little crisper. Probably wouldn''t have cropped it so close to the yearling either. Still, that is a really beautiful picture of the buck. You should be proud of it.', '2008-12-12 09:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126659, 746042, 91282, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this cropped closer to the flower; there''s a petal-less flower right behind it, so the one on the left isn''t really necessary. Also the bottom of the flower is a bit OOF, as opposed to the top half of it, which could have been hidden with cropping the picture closer.</td>', 'I''d like to see this cropped closer to the flower; there''s a petal-less flower right behind it, so the one on the left isn''t really necessary. Also the bottom of the flower is a bit OOF, as opposed to the top half of it, which could have been hidden with cropping the picture closer.', '2008-12-12 09:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126665, 745871, 91282, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this doesn''t say B&amp;A to me at all. With the title, it seems like too much of a stretch. I also would like to see a better composition on it. The cans being cut out of the frame (particularly the edge of the Dr Pepper can being cut) is bothersome to me. The picture is very colorful and clear though. I especially like the Rockstar can; it catches the light really well.</td>', 'Without the title, this doesn''t say B&A to me at all. With the title, it seems like too much of a stretch. I also would like to see a better composition on it. The cans being cut out of the frame (particularly the edge of the Dr Pepper can being cut) is bothersome to me. The picture is very colorful and clear though. I especially like the Rockstar can; it catches the light really well.', '2008-12-12 09:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126668, 746031, 91282, '<td valign="top">A couple of problems I find with this photograph: The way the Jameson bottle is cut off, and the table cloth. The cloth makes things too busy; Something simpler would''ve worked better, IMHO. And the cut of the Jameson bottle just looks so odd to me. Either a higher crop so we can see the whole bottle, or maybe laying it on its side, would''ve made it better.</td>', 'A couple of problems I find with this photograph: The way the Jameson bottle is cut off, and the table cloth. The cloth makes things too busy; Something simpler would''ve worked better, IMHO. And the cut of the Jameson bottle just looks so odd to me. Either a higher crop so we can see the whole bottle, or maybe laying it on its side, would''ve made it better.', '2008-12-12 10:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126672, 746005, 91282, '<td valign="top">I love the color. The lighting and the setup feel mediocre to me though. The shot just feels uninteresting to me.</td>', 'I love the color. The lighting and the setup feel mediocre to me though. The shot just feels uninteresting to me.', '2008-12-12 10:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126675, 746167, 91282, '<td valign="top">So subtle that you don''t really notice.. I''m not so sure that black and white was a good pick here.</td>', 'So subtle that you don''t really notice.. I''m not so sure that black and white was a good pick here.', '2008-12-12 10:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126678, 745818, 91282, '<td valign="top">This makes me hungry for pretzels. haha Cute picture and set up. Conveys the challenge well. The crumbs from "the bite" are entertaining; If someone eats one pretzel that messily, what do they look like after a whole bag? :P</td>', 'This makes me hungry for pretzels. haha Cute picture and set up. Conveys the challenge well. The crumbs from "the bite" are entertaining; If someone eats one pretzel that messily, what do they look like after a whole bag? :P', '2008-12-12 10:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126679, 745752, 91282, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming that''s the "new pier" in the background? I probably wouldn''t have figured that out without the title.. Good shot and an interesting take on the challenge, but it just doesn''t quite do it for me personally.</td>', 'I''m assuming that''s the "new pier" in the background? I probably wouldn''t have figured that out without the title.. Good shot and an interesting take on the challenge, but it just doesn''t quite do it for me personally.', '2008-12-12 10:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126680, 745120, 91282, '<td valign="top">This is very bright and fun. :) I probably would''ve removed the red and white cloth and the knife, though. My eye was drawn to those right away in stead of being immediately drawn to the orange subjects.</td>', 'This is very bright and fun. :) I probably would''ve removed the red and white cloth and the knife, though. My eye was drawn to those right away in stead of being immediately drawn to the orange subjects.', '2008-12-12 10:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126685, 744965, 91282, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the challenge! Though I feel like the lighting or the background being changed a little could have made this more interesting.</td>', 'This certainly meets the challenge! Though I feel like the lighting or the background being changed a little could have made this more interesting.', '2008-12-12 10:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126687, 745757, 91282, '<td valign="top">Those are some beautiful leaves. They contrast really well, and most certainly meet the challenge. Some parts are OOF, which some might complain about, but I think it adds to the character of the photograph. This is one of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Those are some beautiful leaves. They contrast really well, and most certainly meet the challenge. Some parts are OOF, which some might complain about, but I think it adds to the character of the photograph. This is one of my favorites so far.', '2008-12-12 10:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126689, 746199, 91282, '<td valign="top">I would''ve cloned out the dusties (especially whatever is coming off the cracked egg), but otherwise this is an excellent shot (I almost used "eggcellent", but I have a feeling that joke has probably already been made somewhere in the challenge. :P). <br/> <br/>Did you notice that if you look only at the top egg, it looks kind of like a picture of the moon?</td>', 'I would''ve cloned out the dusties (especially whatever is coming off the cracked egg), but otherwise this is an excellent shot (I almost used "eggcellent", but I have a feeling that joke has probably already been made somewhere in the challenge. :P).  Did you notice that if you look only at the top egg, it looks kind of like a picture of the moon?', '2008-12-12 10:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126694, 746028, 91282, '<td valign="top">I think I would''ve brought the oranges in the back up closer or not had them there at all. Having them way back and OOF is distracting. I like the crispness of the sliced orange in front of the glass; Would have been a good shot with just that and the glass on the table cloth, actually.</td>', 'I think I would''ve brought the oranges in the back up closer or not had them there at all. Having them way back and OOF is distracting. I like the crispness of the sliced orange in front of the glass; Would have been a good shot with just that and the glass on the table cloth, actually.', '2008-12-12 10:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5126695, 745375, 91282, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and colorful subject, but the lighting isn''t so great and its OOF.</td>', 'Beautiful and colorful subject, but the lighting isn''t so great and its OOF.', '2008-12-12 10:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
