(5137542, 745357, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautifully set up, Susan, and really, really makes me want to make some mashed potatoes - haven''t had any good homemade ones in ages!  My one suggestion would be to whiten it up a bit - seems just a tad yellowish, due to the color of the overhead lights.  Easiest to do when you shoot RAW, by changing the temperature setting to more toward the blue side.  Very nice job with the focus, too - interesting how the lens you finally used ended up being the one that gave you the best focus - I''d not have thought so, so good on you for experimenting!  This REALLY does deserve a better score, by the way.</td>', 'Beautifully set up, Susan, and really, really makes me want to make some mashed potatoes - haven''t had any good homemade ones in ages!  My one suggestion would be to whiten it up a bit - seems just a tad yellowish, due to the color of the overhead lights.  Easiest to do when you shoot RAW, by changing the temperature setting to more toward the blue side.  Very nice job with the focus, too - interesting how the lens you finally used ended up being the one that gave you the best focus - I''d not have thought so, so good on you for experimenting!  This REALLY does deserve a better score, by the way.', '2008-12-17 15:27:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5137543, 745949, 30982, '<td valign="top">Makes perfect sense to me, and this is a GORGEOUS shot.  Love the high contrast B&amp;W and the nifty balance of it with the crib, cow and tree.  The bird on top is a delightful bonus!  The washed out winter sky is just right for this, too.  Very nice!</td>', 'Makes perfect sense to me, and this is a GORGEOUS shot.  Love the high contrast B&W and the nifty balance of it with the crib, cow and tree.  The bird on top is a delightful bonus!  The washed out winter sky is just right for this, too.  Very nice!', '2008-12-17 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5137545, 746213, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting some of the comments - pretty much looked like water before and after hitting the number where it changes form from solid to liquid.  And not only does it have a fleur de lis, it has an exclamation point!</td>', 'Interesting some of the comments - pretty much looked like water before and after hitting the number where it changes form from solid to liquid.  And not only does it have a fleur de lis, it has an exclamation point!', '2008-12-17 15:33:35.000000', NULL, 0),
