(5142305, 745374, 59029, '<td valign="top">Connor, you leave terrific comments and you take very, very good pictures, and you''re only 13?!  OMG...<br/> <br/>Not that I think you need further inspiration, but who knows, maybe you''ll turn into another <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=25397" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Joey Lawrence</a>.  Check out his portfolio!<br/> <br/>Susan<br/> <br/>PS What, nobody has faved this?! That''s an outrage! Better change that! :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-12-20 08:22:19.</i></td>', 'Connor, you leave terrific comments and you take very, very good pictures, and you''re only 13?!  OMG... Not that I think you need further inspiration, but who knows, maybe you''ll turn into another  Joey Lawrence.  Check out his portfolio! Susan PS What, nobody has faved this?! That''s an outrage! Better change that! :-)', '2008-12-20 08:11:17.000000', '2008-12-20 08:22:19.000000', 0),
