(5155987, 745676, 61788, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for comments - I find some good points in all your messages - though not all match my taste.<br/> <br/>Interesting observation, smudgeSMJ :)    You see, smoking has different dangers ;)<br/> <br/>Rating clearly shows that my attempt to say something like "young become old when smoking" was not successful; for different reasons - both technical and aesthetical. <br/> <br/>jeger, I was not trying to present cigarettes before and after. That''s why hands are important :)   But I appreciate your comment - it helps me anyway.<br/> <br/>Happy New Year!<br/></td>', 'Thank you everyone for comments - I find some good points in all your messages - though not all match my taste. Interesting observation, smudgeSMJ :)    You see, smoking has different dangers ;) Rating clearly shows that my attempt to say something like "young become old when smoking" was not successful; for different reasons - both technical and aesthetical.  jeger, I was not trying to present cigarettes before and after. That''s why hands are important :)   But I appreciate your comment - it helps me anyway. Happy New Year!', '2008-12-29 03:21:52.000000', NULL, 0),
